    "SubTopic": "Multiplication of fractions",
    "Difficulty": "Advanced",
    "Explanation": "2/3 \u00d7 6/7 \u00d7 7/4 = (2\u00d76\u00d77)/(3\u00d77\u00d74) = 84/84 = 1. Wait: 84/84=1 not 1/2. Recalculate: 2\u00d76=12, 12\u00d77=84 (numerator); 3\u00d77=21, 21\u00d74=84 (denominator). 84/84=1. The correct answer among options should be rechecked. Option A is 1/2 but answer is 1. Correcting option A to 1."
